<a href="Uttar-Pradesh-Destinations/Allahabad.aspx"><strong>Allahabad Tour</strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Allahabad.jpg" alt="Allahabad tour" class="thumb alignright" style="width:120px;height:100px;float:right"  title="Allahabad tour"  />
<p>A city of many dimensions is what befits a description of Allahabad. Hindu mythology states that Lord Brahma, the creator god, chose a land for 'Prakrishta Yajna'. The city boasts off some of the most famous parks and museums in India apart from regular attractions.<a href="Uttar-Pradesh-Destinations/Allahabad.aspx">MORE...</a> 
</p>
