<a href="West-Bengal-Destinations/Durgapur.aspx"><strong>Durgapur Tour</strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/durgapur--barrage.jpg" alt="Durgapur tour, Durgapur Barrage" title="Durgapur tour, Durgapur Barrage" class="thumb alignright"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:right" />
<p>Steel city Durgapur has brought India in the light of industrialization. Great thinker Dr. Bidhan Chandra Roy dreamt to make Durgapur an apparent industrial town. Joseph Allen Stein and Benjamin Polk designed the well laid industrial township.<a href="West-Bengal-Destinations/Durgapur.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
