<a href="Sikkim-Destinations/Gangtok.aspx"><strong>Gangtok Tour</strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Rumtek-Monastery.jpg" alt="Rumtek Monastery, Sikkim tour" title="Rumtek Monastery, Sikkim tour" class="thumb alignleft"  style="width:120px;height:100px;float:left" />
<p>Gangtok, the capital city of Sikkim, situated 110 kms from Siliguri and at an altitude of 1547 metres above the sea level, is filled with different cultures, religions and people existing in perfect harmony. Gangtok presents a perfect example of harmony between traditions and modernity.<a href="Sikkim-Destinations/Gangtok.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
<br/>
<br/>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
